    kryos: { name: "Warden Kryos", role: "Founder of the Iron Wardens", description: "A centuries-old Voltari general rebuilt after the War of Golden Machines. His fear of hesitation is earned, but his demand for decisive power repeatedly tests the civilization he means to defend." },
